en=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.5 11a7.5 7.5 0 1 0 15 0a7.5 7.5 0 1 0 -15 0\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Filter compliance</span><input class=\"input\" placeholder=\"Filter by message, rule or rule set…\" type=\"search\" value=\"\"><span class=\"kbd view-header__kbd\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span></label><div class=\"row row--wrap\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quick filters\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Include resolved<span class=\"chip__count\">0</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Critical<span class=\"chip__count\">1</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">High<span class=\"chip__count\">7</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Medium<span class=\"chip__count\">5</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Low<span class=\"chip__count\">3</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">baseline</button></div><div class=\"saved-views row\"></div></div></header><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"table\" aria-label=\"Compliance\" tabindex=\"0\"><thead><tr><th class=\"check\"><input class=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select the rows on screen\" type=\"checkbox\"></th><th aria-sort=\"ascending\" style=\"width: 110px;\"><button type=\"button\">Severity<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-icon=\"chevronUp\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m18 15-6-6-6 6\"></path></svg></button></th><th><button type=\"button\">Compliance finding</button></th><th class=\"num\" style=\"width: 80px;\"><button type=\"button\">Active</button></th><th class=\"num\" style=\"width: 80px;\"><button type=\"button\">Hosts</button></th><th style=\"width: 140px;\">Triage</th><th style=\"width: 120px;\"><button type=\"button\">Last seen</button></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-index=\"0\"><td class=\"check\"><input class=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select row\" type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><span class=\"badge badge--critical\">Critical</span></td><td><div class=\"cell-two\"><span class=\"truncate\"> The unencrypted Docker API (tcp 2375) listens on a non-loopback address; anyone who reaches it controls the host. Bind it to a Unix socket or loopback, or use TLS on 2376. </span><span class=\"mono subtle\">port.docker_api.exposed · baseline</span></div></td><td class=\"num\"><strong class=\"num\" title=\"4 open\">4</strong></td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"num\">4</span></td><td><div class=\"triage-bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 Open, 0 Mitigated, 0 Accepted risk, 0 False positive\"><span title=\"4 Open\" style=\"flex-grow: 4; background: var(--bad);\"></span><span class=\"sr-only\">4</span></div></td><td><span class=\"subtle\"><time class=\"nowrap\" title=\"16 Oct 2026, 16:56\" datetime=\"2026-10-16T14:56:47.963Z\">just now</time></span></td></tr><tr data-index=\"1\"><td class=\"check\"><input class=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select row\" type=\"checkbox\"></td><td><span class=\"badge badge--high\">High</span></td><td><div class=\"cell-two\"><span class=\"truncate\"> Redis (tcp 6379) listens on a non-loopback address; by default it has no password and can be used to write files. Bind it to loopback, or firewall it and require authentication. </span><span class=\"mono subtle\">port.redis.exposed · baseline</span></div></td><td class=\"num\"><strong class=\"num\" title=\"5 open\">5</strong></td><td class=\"num\"><span class=\"num\">5</span></td><td><div class=\"triage-bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 Open, 0 Mitigated, 0 Accepted risk, 0 False positive\"><span title=\"5 Open\" style=\"flex-grow: 5; background: var(--bad);\"></span><span class=\"sr-only\">5</span></div></td><td><span class=\"subtle\"><time class=\"nowrap\" title=\"16 Oct 2026, 16:5